## Navigation by Intention

The Quantum Navigator allows you to navigate by intention rather than explicit links:

```bash
UQDS [OBSERVE]> navigate I want to understand how to integrate quantum fields
```

The system will identify the most relevant documentation based on your intention.

## Quick Start Examples

### Creating a New Project

```bash
UQDS [CREATE]> build quantum_api_service default
Building project: quantum_api_service default
Project created at /mnt/d/cqil/documentation/projects/quantum_api_service
```

### Generating Documentation

```bash
UQDS [CREATE]> generate api QuantumAuthenticationService
Generating documentation: api QuantumAuthenticationService
Documentation generated at /mnt/d/cqil/documentation/References/QuantumAuthenticationService_API.md
```

### Visualizing Documentation

```bash
UQDS [OBSERVE]> visualize /mnt/d/cqil/documentation coherence
